    "text": "By Jessica Sealey For The Robesonian ,\n5 hours ago LUMBERTON — The Public Schools of Robeson County’s Director of Curriculum and Instruction has received the highest honor for her work in the 2025-2026 cohort of the Relay Graduate School of Education’s Leverage Leadership Institute Fellowship. Debra Dowless has been recognized as a Platinum Plus Leader for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
